cff-version: 1.2.0
title: MAMUT-routing-TDVRP-Ari2018
type: dataset
message: >-
  Cite this metadata for the Ari2018 TDVRP adaptation, generated vehicle-routing attributes and benchmark selection. Also cite the Arigliano et al. TD-TSPTW distribution for the underlying data. Record the exact Git commit used.
