url: "https://github.com/ANR-MAMUT/MAMUT-routing-TDVRP-Ari2018"
abstract: >-
  This 160-instance TDVRP benchmark adapts the Arigliano et al. TD-TSPTW distribution to capacitated multi-vehicle routing. It combines generated demands, capacities, fleet sizes and service times with deterministic selection across the source benchmark parameters and canonical arrival-time functions. Time windows are removed to provide twins of the corresponding TDVRPTW instances. The listed authors contribute the routing adaptation, instance selection, validation and benchmark publication. Underlying travel-time data and generator attribution are documented in README.md.
